 <h2 class="sr-only">You Don't Need Every Service. You Need the Right Strategy.</h2>
 <div class="strategy-text"><p>There is no shortage of MBA and Master's admissions consultants, specialist services or opinions. But few start by asking the most important question: What do you actually need?</p><p>At Astradmit, we put your goals before services. Through honest profile assessments, personalised 1:1 mentoring and access to vetted industry specialists, we help you identify what matters, where expert support can add value, and how to move forward with a realistic, budget-aligned plan.</p><p class="strategy-cta"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="about.html">More about Astradmit</a></p></div>
